with nothing but my thoughts.

11:36.862 --> 11:38.889
<i>But I don't want
to kill all these people!</i>

11:38.891 --> 11:41.316
<i>I don't care about the
alignment of the dark forces!</i>

11:41.318 --> 11:43.809
<i>Leave me alone!</i>

11:45.009 --> 11:46.970
<i>Cleveland:
I love my wife donna.</i>

11:46.972 --> 11:49.829
<i>I wish she and peter's wife
got along better.</i>

11:49.831 --> 11:52.357
<i>That's why
we're on this airplane.</i>

11:52.359 --> 11:54.585
<i>I'm cleveland.</i>

11:56.847 --> 11:58.543
