(laughing)

14:02.418 --> 14:05.010
Wow. Wow!

14:05.012 --> 14:07.336
Dad, what are you
doing down here?

14:07.338 --> 14:08.901
Eh, your mom's making me
sleep on the couch

14:08.903 --> 14:10.498
'cause she caught me
hanging out with cleveland.

14:10.500 --> 14:11.627
How about you?

14:11.629 --> 14:13.656
Mom's making me sleep
in the basement.

14:13.658 --> 14:16.316
