16:07.720 --> 16:08.917
(crying):
Oh, cleveland,

16:08.919 --> 16:12.775
I'm gonna hate
those griffins forever.

16:12.777 --> 16:15.434
Only my side had airbags.

16:17.597 --> 16:19.658
Peter, what are we doing here?

16:19.660 --> 16:21.852
Well, women will
